apulse
======

The shared libraries in this directory (libpulse.so.0, libpulse-simple.so.0,
libpulse-mainloop-glib.so.0, and the apulse launcher) are builds of apulse.

Upstream: https://github.com/i-rinat/apulse
Pinned revision: see SOURCE_REVISION in each architecture directory.
Build recipe: docker/ and scripts/build-apulse.sh in the project repository.

