Statically linked components
----------------------------

These libraries link GLib and PCRE2 statically, because libglib2.0 is not
present on a stock Volumio 4 image. Both are LGPL-2.1-or-later.

See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md in the project repository for the full notice,
including how to rebuild and relink these libraries from source.
